    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102926" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελειογον-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>perfect production</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγονον εἰς τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				748b7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				774b34
			</span></i>:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεογονία</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				249
			</span></i>, is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστεολογίη</span>
			, which Littré adopts from cod.C.</div>
